U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1620748246.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ia1z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2dbef16e-db0b-49b5-9da0-abbc2378b294","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"はい、もうチャットでやりました。あのチャットすごいですよね。レスポンスむっちゃ速い。補完（というかスニペット）がすごいんだと思います。バンバン定型文みたいなの打ってくる","ts":"1620748152.471700","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1620748188.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U01J7703PFT","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fsE4w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c58fb24-1ae6-43cc-869a-dc7b5ce5312d","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"Amazonにクレーム出すしか無いですねこれは・・・","ts":"1620748016.469900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HAyB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abc8708d-7007-42f9-a1e0-74b8cc2069ea","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まあけど最近Amazonってサインレスで受け取るときも遠目から１秒以内くらいで急かしながら名前確認させられるから、はいって言っちゃうのはわかる気もしますね。\n今頃私のCO2メーターはメルカリかな・・・","ts":"1620747948.469200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U1m5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95d7b5c5-a2c4-41fb-8cf3-68a76a9fe904","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"「yutkatさんでお間違いないですか？」\n「いいえ」\n「ではここにサインを」\n「はい」\n\nよし、なにもかも分からない","ts":"1620747773.466800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LyyF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42bc9f68-cc83-4bfd-b2f3-e1438761f8bc","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"普通は渡す時に名前確認しますよね・・・？\n意味の分からないことが重なり過ぎですわ","ts":"1620747718.465900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R8H6m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ec10b05-c94a-440b-8666-ddbde371cf6a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"しかもその大阪の人も名前違うわけだから拒否ればいいのに受け取ってるんですよねw\n私の買ったCO2メーターをw